---

The SGP4/SDP4 propagation code in satellite_observer is a port of the
public-domain reference implementation by David Vallado et al., "Revisiting
Spacetrack Report #3" (AIAA 2006-6753). Attribution is retained in-source.
The package additionally identifies MIT-licensed python-sgp4 (Brandon Rhodes)
as the source of its Dart port. This file covers the translated numerical
portions of satellite_sgp4.cpp and satellite_coefficients.dart, including the
translated GMST, observer WGS-84 position and topocentric look-angle/range-rate
transforms used by native pass grids.
